1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Those dragon heads on the Forbidden City's terraces?
{\fs13}I'm your China Travel Expert

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Not decoration — they're the drains.

3
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:08,500
Rain hits three tiers of marble and runs to the edge.

4
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:13,500
It pours straight out through the carved dragon mouths —

5
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:18,500
more than a thousand of them, flinging it clear of the base.

6
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:21,500
Double-tap if you'd never have guessed.

7
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:26,000
So the footing stays dry. 600 years, no flooding.

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,500
★ Expert Tip: go on a rainy day — that's when the dragons "spit."

9
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:31,000
Decoration or drainage — did you know? Tell me I'm wrong below.
